# Git Ignore untuk Smart Inventory System & Machine Learning Pipeline
# Mencegah file bobot model besar (>100MB) atau arsip ter-push ke GitHub

# 1. Arsip & Dataset Mentah Besar
*.zip
*.tar.gz
*.rar
*.parquet

# 2. File Bobot Model / Weights
*.safetensors
*.bin
*.pt
*.pth
*.onnx

# 3. Environment & Checkpoints
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.venv/
env/
venv/
*.log

# 4. Large model directories (jika ingin exclude folder model hasil training)
# models/sbert_finetuned/model.safetensors

